    <description></description>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":1} -->
<h1>Welcome to the Harbor Street Garden Club</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We are 60 neighbors who share 40 garden plots behind the library. Every <strong>Saturday morning</strong> from April to October, the gate is open and the coffee is on.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image -->
<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://harborstreetgardens.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/garden-plot-300x200.png" alt="Raised beds in late May, with tomato cages going up" class="wp-image-41"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>New here? Start with <a href="https://harborstreetgardens.example/about-us/">who we are</a> or see <a href="https://harborstreetgardens.example/events/">what is coming up</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
