  <item>
    <title>About Us</title>
    <link>https://harborstreetgardens.example/about-us/</link>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>How we started</h2>
<p>In 2011 a few of us asked the city for the empty lot behind the library. It took two years and a lot of wheelbarrows.</p>
<h3>Who runs it</h3>
<ul><li>A volunteer board of five</li><li>One plot captain for each row</li></ul>]]></content:encoded>
