  <item>
    <title>What We Do</title>
    <link>https://harborstreetgardens.example/what-we-do/</link>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[Plot rental runs $30 a season, and a few plots are free for households that ask.

Our <em>Seed Library</em> lends out seeds in March. Bring back seeds from your best plant in the fall.

[gallery ids="41,42" columns="2"]]]></content:encoded>
